      438.07,
      286.44,
      497.58
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7, of Land Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964, (Amendement) that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
