    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      509.86,
      286.44,
      627.43
    ],
    "text": "An Allotment of Land called \u201cNaligewatta\u201d in total extent of about 1.9141 Hectares depicted as Lot \u201cA\u201d in the Sheet No. 24, Supplement No. 24 of F. V. P. No. 701 dated 19.01.2015, prepared by Surveyor General, situated in the village called Pannila in Pannilpattuwa Minor Division in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 226 of Pannila in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division Kahawatta in Rathnapura District of the Sabaragamuwa Province and more fully described as follows:",
